    filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop f0] with f h; refine ⟨h,R, Sq 0 R _, Wp.go ..,?_⟩; unfold Y BullZFe; rw[dif_pos h]; exact (RankRentR p B0 M 0 R pu A D h m dΩ Sq Wp L0 false Z hp).2.2) _ Ξ (tendsto_const_nhds (x:=Ξ)) (RootApR P) -- tune
